1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,961
Let's check in using 3 quick questions.

2
00:00:03,001 --> 00:00:07,933
Plan: before you started the lab, what did you decide to try on your own?

3
00:00:07,973 --> 00:00:13,235
Monitor: when you got stuck, what did you notice in your body and your thoughts?

4
00:00:13,275 --> 00:00:16,341
Evaluate: did I think first?

5
00:00:16,381 --> 00:00:18,320
Yes, partly,

6
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:21,792
or not this time, all honest answers.

7
00:00:21,832 --> 00:00:25,342
Then count how many times you used STOP this week.

8
00:00:25,382 --> 00:00:31,121
And one last time, rate your anxiety and curiosity about AI 0 to 10.

9
00:00:31,161 --> 00:00:35,083
Be kind to yourself with whatever you find.
